        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "feat(ios): implement branded typography design system",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nThe iOS app currently uses the system font (SF Pro) throughout, providing no visual brand identity. This makes the app feel generic and indistinguishable from default iOS apps.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nIntroduces a branded typography system using Plus Jakarta Sans (headings), DM Sans (body), and JetBrains Mono (code). All fonts are bundled with SIL OFL 1.1 license. Typography tokens (`OpenClawType`) support Dynamic Type accessibility scaling. Shared design components (spacing, radius, toggle, badge, button styles) consolidate scattered magic values into reusable tokens.\n\nThis is a cosmetic-only change — no behavioral, routing, or structural modifications.\n\n## User Impact\n\nUsers see a refined, branded typeface across all iOS screens (Settings, Chat, Onboarding, Agent views). Dynamic Type continues to work. No functional behavior changes.\n\n## Evidence\n\n**Build verification (clean worktree from `upstream/main`):**\n```\n$ git cherry-pick bb03d000d5  # typography commit only\n$ pnpm ios:gen\n$ xcodebuild build -scheme OpenClaw -destination 'platform=iOS Simulator,id=...' -quiet\n# Build Succeeded (no errors)\n```\n\n**i18n check:**\n```\n$ pnpm native:i18n:sync\nnative-app-i18n: entries=2365 changed=true\n$ pnpm native:i18n:check\nnative-app-i18n: entries=2365 changed=false  ✓\n```\n\n**Before/after simulator proof (iPhone 17 Pro, iOS 26):**\n\nCaptured from clean `upstream/main` build vs PR branch build:\n- Settings (light): System SF Pro → Plus Jakarta Sans headings, DM Sans body text\n- Settings (dark): Same typography swap with proper adaptive colors\n- Chat: Font swap visible in agent name, message text, placeholder; `OpenClawStatusBadge` renders \"Connected\" pill\n\n**Fonts bundled (all SIL OFL 1.1):**\n\n| Font | Weight variants | Source |\n|------|----------------|--------|\n| Plus Jakarta Sans | Light, Regular, Medium, SemiBold, Bold, ExtraBold | tokotype/PlusJakartaSans |\n| DM Sans | Light, Regular, Medium, SemiBold, Italic | googlefonts/dm-fonts |\n| JetBrains Mono | Regular, Medium, SemiBold | JetBrains/JetBrainsMono |\n\n**Scope — what is NOT in this PR:**\n- No accent color changes\n- No RootTabs/navigation behavior changes\n- No Settings routing changes\n- No onboarding structural changes\n- No gateway problem banner changes\n\nSupersedes #99161 (closed, stale branch history).\n\n— [Joel Nishanth](https://offlyn.ai) · [offlyn.AI](https://offlyn.ai)\n\nMade with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)",
